        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 個月前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "稻香集團旗下的中式食肆 走中高檔路線 早上有中式早茶 晚市有小菜點心 這家中式食肆已經在赤柱多年了 是難得的經營者 食物味道還不錯 有時候會做主題食物推廣 如果你對中式餐飲有要求可以來這裏嘗試一下 是南區少有的中菜選擇\n\nThe Chinese restaurant under Daoxiang Group takes the middle and high-end route. There are Chinese morning tea in the morning and snacks in the evening. This Chinese restaurant has been in Stanley for many years. It is a rare operator. The food tastes good. Sometimes it will do theme food promotion. If you have any requirements for Chinese catering, you can come here to try it. It is a rare choice of Chinese cuisine in the South District.",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
